menuconfig SYSTEMCMDS_ZTCS_ENROLL
	bool "ztcs_enroll"
	default n
	depends on LIB_ZTCS_SECURE_LINK
	---help---
		Enrol this aircraft on the secure MAVLink link: read the link
		public key out, and write the ground station key and the identity
		payload back in. The ground end is ztcs-mavlink-provision.
